// `SelfBuff` cannot deliver this: the sheet's range is Touch and the
// description reads "the touched creature's skin" (third person), which
// `SelfBuff` can never satisfy since it always lands on the caster
// (`entity: data.entity`, `common/src/states/self_buff.rs`). Uses the same
// touch-ally pattern as this folder's own `weave_transfusion.ron` /
// `hollow/spare_the_dying.ron` (`attack_effect_target: Some(InGroup)` on a
// near-inert `Stab`).
// No "hard floor on armor regardless of what's worn" primitive exists in
// `BuffEffect` (checked `common/src/comp/buff.rs` in full) -- modeled with
// `ProtectingWard` (flat damage reduction) instead, the nearest existing
// defensive buff, at a modest strength reflecting a minimum-AC floor rather
// than a strong ward.
BasicMelee(
    energy_cost: 35.0,
    buildup_duration: 0.4,
    swing_duration: 0.1,
    hit_timing: 0.5,
    recover_duration: 0.4,
    melee_constructor: (
        kind: Stab(damage: 1, poise: 0, knockback: 0, energy_regen: 0),
        range: 3.0,
        angle: 20.0,
        attack_effect: Some((
            Buff((
                kind: ProtectingWard,
                dur_secs: 60.0,
                strength: Value(0.3),
                chance: 1.0,
            )),
            AttackSource(Melee),
        )),
        attack_effect_target: Some(InGroup),
    ),
    meta: (
        school: Some(Transmutation),
        source: Some(Primordial),
        // level 2 spell -> min_level 12, same `level * 6` convention.
        requirements: (min_level: Some(12)),
    ),
)
